  "summary": "每笔交易先支付 cost 后返还 cashback，必须保证无论以何种顺序执行都能完成全部交易，求所需的最少初始金额。",
  "insight": "所有亏损交易必造成 totalLoss=sum(max(0,cost-cashback))。最后承担峰值的某笔交易还需在总亏损之外准备 min(cost,cashback)，取所有交易最大值。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "交易顺序可任意",
    "即使盈利交易也可能决定最后峰值",
    "答案使用 long"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "total-loss-plus-largest-final-buffer",
      "title": "总亏损加最大末笔缓冲",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "把不可避免亏损与单笔启动资金分离。",
      "steps": [
        "totalLoss 累加 max(0,cost-cashback)",
        "buffer=max(buffer,min(cost,cashback))",
        "返回 totalLoss+buffer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/total-loss-plus-largest-final-buffer/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/total-loss-plus-largest-final-buffer/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/total-loss-plus-largest-final-buffer/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
